#: src/Modules/Payments/OfflineGateway.php:96
msgid "\"On hold\" is recommended. WooCommerce treats \"Processing\" as paid: it sets the paid date, and e-mails and plugins may tell the customer that the payment was received. Choose \"Processing\" only when an invoice or fulfilment plugin needs it."
